  "statuteText": "265-A:32 Period of License Suspension. –\n\nWhere a license or driving privilege has been suspended under RSA 265-A:30 and the person is also convicted on criminal charges arising out of the same event both the suspension and the court-ordered revocation shall be imposed but the total period of suspension and revocation shall not exceed the longer of the 2 periods; provided, however, that any suspension for refusing to submit to a test under the provisions of RSA 265-A:14 shall not run concurrently with any other penalty imposed under the provisions of this title."
